224
00:13:03,025 --> 00:13:05,420
Fix it so it works in both kinds

225
00:13:05,420 --> 00:13:07,815
of application, and fix the second team's bug.

226
00:13:07,815 --> 00:13:09,312
What else would you change?

227
00:13:15,962 --> 00:13:19,086
PERF-001 · Why it depends on zone.js

228
00:13:20,211 --> 00:13:24,207
Zone-based Angular uses patched asynchronous activity as a broad check trigger.

229
00:13:24,207 --> 00:13:27,114
This can make plain fields appear to work,

230
00:13:27,114 --> 00:13:31,475
but it is not a guarantee for every promise, native asynchronous API,

231
00:13:31,475 --> 00:13:33,292
or callback outside the zone.

232
00:13:34,667 --> 00:13:37,701
PERF-001 · Why it depends on zone.js

233
00:13:38,826 --> 00:13:43,208
A zoneless application (the default for new Angular applications) only runs change

234
00:13:43,208 --> 00:13:46,859
detection when something tells it to: a template event listener,

235
00:13:46,859 --> 00:13:50,876
a signal read by a template changing, markForCheck(), the async pipe,

236
00:13:50,876 --> 00:13:51,606
or setInput.

237
00:13:51,606 --> 00:13:51,972
Here:

238
00:13:53,347 --> 00:13:56,246
PERF-001 · Why it depends on zone.js

239
00:13:57,371 --> 00:14:01,049
The click handler schedules a check, but copied = true happens

240
00:14:01,049 --> 00:14:04,392
after the await, normally once that check has already run.

241
00:14:04,392 --> 00:14:07,067
Nothing schedules another, so "Copied" usually never appears.

242
00:14:07,067 --> 00:14:11,080
Whether it does depends on timing and on unrelated activity elsewhere on

243
00:14:11,080 --> 00:14:14,758
the page, which makes the bug intermittent and hard to reproduce.

244
00:14:14,758 --> 00:14:19,105
The reset in setTimeout has the same problem. - NgZone is a no-op

245
00:14:19,105 --> 00:14:23,452
in zoneless applications, so onStable never emits, and the width is never locked.

246
00:14:24,827 --> 00:14:27,797
PERF-001 · Why it depends on zone.js

247
00:14:28,922 --> 00:14:31,562
A shared library must work in both kinds

248
00:14:31,562 --> 00:14:33,872
of application, and new ones are zoneless.

