00:17:13,747 --> 00:17:16,749
PERF-001 · Other fixes in this version

293
00:17:17,874 --> 00:17:20,987
Errors are handled. writeText rejects when permission is denied

294
00:17:20,987 --> 00:17:23,755
or the page is not a secure context.

295
00:17:23,755 --> 00:17:26,869
The original left an unhandled rejection and no feedback.

296
00:17:26,869 --> 00:17:28,253
The change is announced.

297
00:17:28,253 --> 00:17:31,713
A button's label changing is not reliably announced by screen

298
00:17:31,713 --> 00:17:35,172
readers, so the result is announced through the CDK LiveAnnouncer.

299
00:17:35,172 --> 00:17:38,632
Labels are inputs, so applications can translate them. - visibility:

300
00:17:38,632 --> 00:17:42,092
hidden also removes the inactive label from the accessibility tree,

301
00:17:42,092 --> 00:17:45,552
so the button's accessible name is always the visible label.

302
00:17:46,927 --> 00:17:50,961
PERF-001 · How to make this hold across the library

303
00:17:52,086 --> 00:17:54,775
Run the library's own test suite with provideZonelessChangeDetection().

304
00:17:54,775 --> 00:17:58,473
A component that only works because zone.js happens to trigger change

305
00:17:58,473 --> 00:18:02,172
detection will then fail in tests instead of in a product.

306
00:18:03,547 --> 00:18:05,913
PERF-001 · Follow-up 1

307
00:18:07,038 --> 00:18:11,108
Which Angular APIs schedule change detection in a zoneless application?

308
00:18:11,108 --> 00:18:12,329
Which do not?

309
00:18:17,683 --> 00:18:21,083
Important notifications include a template-consumed signal changing, markForCheck,

310
00:18:21,083 --> 00:18:24,059
component setInput, bound template or host listeners,

311
00:18:24,059 --> 00:18:25,334
and async-pipe emissions.

312
00:18:25,334 --> 00:18:28,310
Attaching an already dirty view also participates.

313
00:18:28,310 --> 00:18:31,711
A raw promise, timeout, or plain field assignment

314
00:18:31,711 --> 00:18:34,687
is not a notification on its own.

315
00:18:34,687 --> 00:18:38,088
NgZone.run does not substitute for a zoneless notification,

316
00:18:38,088 --> 00:18:41,489
although it can remain relevant to zone-based consumers.

317
00:18:41,489 --> 00:18:44,889
Test async updates without manually forcing every render.

318
00:18:46,265 --> 00:18:48,305
PERF-001 · Follow-up 2

319
00:18:49,430 --> 00:18:52,241
A third-party chart library calls back outside Angular.

320
00:18:52,241 --> 00:18:55,405
What do you do with the data it provides?

321
00:19:00,727 --> 00:19:04,216
Adapt the callback to a signal consumed by the template,

322
00:19:04,216 --> 00:19:06,658
an observable exposed through the async pipe,

323
00:19:06,658 --> 00:19:08,403
or a controlled markForCheck path.

324
00:19:08,403 --> 00:19:11,892
Keep subscription cleanup and stale callback handling tied to destruction.

325
00:19:11,892 --> 00:19:14,684
Avoid copying the data into an unobserved field

326
00:19:14,684 --> 00:19:17,126
and hoping another event triggers a render.

327
00:19:17,126 --> 00:19:20,616
If callbacks are extremely frequent, batch according to the UI's

328
00:19:20,616 --> 00:19:24,105
needs and profile the result, while preserving the final state.

329
00:19:24,105 --> 00:19:27,246
Retain zone-boundary optimizations where they matter for zone-based consumers.

330
00:19:28,621 --> 00:19:31,063
PERF-001 · Follow-up 3

331
00:19:32,188 --> 00:19:35,657
How would you find every component in a

332
00:19:35,657 --> 00:19:38,694
large library that only works with zone.js?

333
00:19:43,810 --> 00:19:48,002
Search for zone lifecycle observables, plain fields written by promises

334
00:19:48,002 --> 00:19:51,775
or timers, subscriptions without teardown, and constructor DOM reads.

335
00:19:51,775 --> 00:19:53,871
Treat matches as review candidates.

336
00:19:53,871 --> 00:19:59,741
Run consumer hosts zoneless and exercise async completion, input updates, repeated interaction, and destruction.

337
00:19:59,741 --> 00:20:04,771
Add regression tests for missing notifications instead of forcing global change detection.

338
00:20:04,771 --> 00:20:08,125
Use profiling after correctness to find excessive work,

339
00:20:08,125 --> 00:20:11,898
and test supported framework ranges before claiming library-wide compatibility.

340
00:20:13,273 --> 00:20:15,720
Implementation clarification · Notifications are explicit

341
00:20:16,846 --> 00:20:21,277
Zone-based rendering is not a guarantee for every asynchronous API.

342
00:20:21,277 --> 00:20:27,039
In the tested zoneless flow, state consumed by a template must notify Angular.

343
00:20:28,414 --> 00:20:30,427
Implementation clarification · Overlapping requests

344
00:20:31,552 --> 00:20:35,173
The minimal source correction clears a timer but does

345
00:20:35,173 --> 00:20:38,795
not ignore stale promise completions or completions after destruction.

346
00:20:38,795 --> 00:20:42,819
The supplemental example adds a sequence guard and lifetime check.

347
00:20:44,194 --> 00:20:45,364
Final review checklist

348
00:20:46,489 --> 00:20:50,780
